01:49:44.377 --> 01:49:46.212
Lagi pula, kami akan segera kembali.

01:49:46.213 --> 01:49:47.880
Seattle tak begitu jauh.

01:49:47.881 --> 01:49:50.549
Hanya 35 jam nonstop,

01:49:50.550 --> 01:49:52.009
